<!--
  Flagged, filled: the same octagon with the bar knocked out of it.

  The pair is deliberate. The outline means a refusal is possible; the solid
  one means a refusal happened. Weight is the difference, so the strongest mark
  on any screen is always an actual refusal, and a photograph of the screen
  with the colour taken out still says which of the two it was.
  Redrawn from the hand-drawn source SVG verdict-flagged-solid.svg (kept outside this app's own tree).
-->
